6766:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls.c ****      * this PRF is also used to derive an IV, in particular in EAP-TLS,
6767:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls.c ****      * and for this use case it makes sense to have a 0-length "secret".
6768:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls.c ****      * Since the key API doesn't allow importing a key of length 0,
6769:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls.c ****      * keep master_key=0, which setup_psa_key_derivation() understands
6770:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls.c ****      * to mean a 0-length "secret" input. */
6771:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_tls.c ****     if (slen != 0) {
